        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Great spot for breakfast! The food was fresh and delicious, with a good variety of options. The service was quick and friendly, and the atmosphere was cozy. Highly recommend the pancakes and coffee. Perfect way to start the day!",
        "time": 1729349585,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Judy Hung",
